            {
                "entry_id": "cf68778f-f252-3d86-8260-3c5b656cacda",
                "word": "Sixties",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dbd420d8-36ca-3c14-9bc8-bed1571c947a",
                        "entry_id": "cf68778f-f252-3d86-8260-3c5b656cacda",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The decade of the 1860s, 1960s, etc. (but especially the 1960s)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18861be5-72d4-45eb-800f-96387547e424",
                                "sense_id": "dbd420d8-36ca-3c14-9bc8-bed1571c947a",
                                "text": "Counterculture expert James Riley delves into the darkness of the Sixties to sort fact from psychedelic fiction."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de7a06cc-03c7-4645-9585-dbd09ed6a082",
                                "sense_id": "dbd420d8-36ca-3c14-9bc8-bed1571c947a",
                                "text": "Occasionally this was a direct result of network attitudes — as in the fifties with integration, the sixties with Vietnam, or the seventies with Watergate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bae8bb12-e2b8-42ab-be1c-d83bcd880fd2",
                                "sense_id": "dbd420d8-36ca-3c14-9bc8-bed1571c947a",
                                "text": "Both Burnham and the president were middle-aged baby boomers with an investment in their Sixties youth[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7262148-6f74-4c85-bb89-6a73acc34b94",
                                "sense_id": "dbd420d8-36ca-3c14-9bc8-bed1571c947a",
                                "text": "2017 https://www.independent.co.uk/news/long_reads/sixties-decade-was-it-good-sexual-revolution-swinging-london-hippies-culture-music-art-germaine-a7946506.html\nWhen asked what the Sixties were all about, most people reply: peace, love, happiness."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5dcf0244-8a21-3436-9d50-1df85b8eb5a3",
                        "entry_id": "cf68778f-f252-3d86-8260-3c5b656cacda",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A period in American history centered around the counterculture movement of the late 1960s."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "238e2c23-9de7-474f-a362-216918f770cc",
                                "sense_id": "5dcf0244-8a21-3436-9d50-1df85b8eb5a3",
                                "text": "It is relatively easy to choose some event (Kent State, Altamont, Watergate, and the fall of Saigon are favorites) as the end of the Sixties[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9ef2b04-7582-430e-b1d2-7fe1f02e9138",
                                "sense_id": "5dcf0244-8a21-3436-9d50-1df85b8eb5a3",
                                "text": "The 1960s and the first half of the 1970s—an era known as \"the sixties\" to most observers—has perhaps generated more mythology than any other period in American history."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b2d4962-3aa6-45c0-b873-a69730fe9802",
                                "sense_id": "5dcf0244-8a21-3436-9d50-1df85b8eb5a3",
                                "text": "But the sixties no more ended in 1969 than they began in 1960."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
